  clock: 2  # e9f4
  nonce: e9f4  # e9f4
  message: "Dogfood re-confirmation of the stray-] truncation face. The hypergumbo-tracker pyproject.toml entry in sketch_precomputed.config_info reads '[packages/hypergumbo-tracker/pyproject.toml]\\n  > ] dependencies = [ \"ruamel.yaml>=0.18\",' — the selected one-line chunk cuts inside a TOML array, dropping the [project] header and starting the snippet with a stray ']'. Spec §684 calls sketch_precomputed an internal cache artifact consumers should not depend on, yet docs/schema.json:166 declares config_info as a property (minor spec-vs-schema inconsistency). A consumer reading the snippet gets a fragment that misrepresents the manifest's structure."  # e9f4
- op: discuss  # 09df
  at: '2026-06-08T03:22:05Z'  # 09df
  by: agent  # 09df
